---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Marketing & SEO Studio | Materuni Hosts" description="Research-led SEO, content planning and blog drafting workspace." noindex={true}>
<section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">PRIVATE ADMIN · GROWTH WORKSPACE</span><h1>Marketing & SEO Studio</h1><p>Research opportunities, audit public pages and prepare useful content for Materuni Hosts.</p></section>
<section class="booking-wrap">
 <div class="booking-panel" id="login-panel"><h2>Administrator sign in</h2><form id="login-form" class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="admin-email">Admin email</label><input id="admin-email" type="email" autocomplete="username" required></div><div class="field full"><label for="admin-password">Password</label><input id="admin-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></div><div class="field full"><button class="button" id="login-button">Sign in securely</button><p id="login-feedback" class="muted" aria-live="polite"></p></div></form></div>
 <div id="manager" hidden>
  <div class="admin-topbar"><div class="admin-topbar-links"><a class="button button-secondary" href="/admin/">← Dashboard</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/admin/seo">SEO Metadata</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/sitemap.xml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sitemap ↗</a></div><button class="button button-secondary" id="logout">Sign out</button></div>
  <div class="booking-panel" style="margin-top:1rem"><span class="eyebrow">AUTOMATED ON-PAGE CHECK</span><h2>Website SEO crawler</h2><p class="muted">Checks live public pages from the website itself. It does not pretend to have Google rankings or backlink data.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="audit-scope">Pages to inspect</label><select id="audit-scope"><option value="sitemap">URLs from sitemap.xml</option><option value="core">Core pages only</option></select></div><div class="field" style="align-self:end"><button class="button" id="run-audit" type="button">Run live audit</button></div></div><p id="audit-status" class="muted" aria-live="polite">Not run yet.</p><div class="admin-stats"><div class="admin-stat"><span>Pages checked</span><strong id="audit-count">—</strong></div><div class="admin-stat"><span>Issues found</span><strong id="audit-issues">—</strong></div><div class="admin-stat"><span>Missing H1</span><strong id="audit-h1">—</strong></div><div class="admin-stat"><span>Missing descriptions</span><strong id="audit-meta">—</strong></div></div><div id="audit-results" style="overflow:auto;margin-top:1rem"></div></div>
  <div class="booking-panel" style="margin-top:1rem"><span class="eyebrow">RESEARCH WORKBENCH</span><h2>SEO opportunity brief</h2><p class="muted">Create a structured research brief for a topic. Suggestions are hypotheses to validate with Search Console, keyword tools and competitor sources—not fabricated search-volume figures.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="topic">Topic or experience</label><input id="topic" placeholder="e.g. Chagga traditional coffee experience" /></div><div class="field"><label for="audience">Target visitor</label><select id="audience"><option>International travellers visiting Moshi</option><option>Culture and heritage travellers</option><option>Kilimanjaro visitors adding a day trip</option><option>Responsible tourism researchers</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="intent">Search intent</label><select id="intent"><option>Informational</option><option>Commercial investigation</option><option>Transactional</option></select></div><div class="field full"><button class="button" id="make-brief" type="button">Build research brief</button></div></div><div id="research-output" class="booking-panel" hidden style="margin-top:1rem"></div></div>
  <div class="booking-panel" style="margin-top:1rem"><span class="eyebrow">BLOG POST STUDIO</span><h2>Blog editor & SEO checklist</h2><p class="muted">Draft and refine an article. Save a working copy in this browser; publishing is intentionally not enabled until a secure blog publishing workflow is connected.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="blog-title">Article title</label><input id="blog-title" maxlength="150" placeholder="Enter a useful, specific headline" /></div><div class="field"><label for="blog-keyword">Primary keyword</label><input id="blog-keyword" placeholder="Primary search phrase" /></div><div class="field"><label for="blog-slug">Suggested URL slug</label><input id="blog-slug" placeholder="article-url-slug" /></div><div class="field full"><label for="blog-description">Meta description</label><textarea id="blog-description" rows="2" maxlength="160" placeholder="Summarise the article in a clear search snippet"></textarea><small id="description-count" class="muted">0 / 160 characters</small></div><div class="field full"><label for="blog-body">Article draft (Markdown supported)</label><textarea id="blog-body" rows="16" placeholder="# Introduction&#10;&#10;Write an accurate, useful article grounded in local knowledge..."></textarea></div><div class="field full"><div class="actions"><button class="button button-secondary" id="save-draft" type="button">Save draft on this device</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="export-draft" type="button">Export Markdown</button></div><p id="blog-feedback" class="muted" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div><div id="blog-checks" class="muted"></div></div>
  <div class="booking-panel" style="margin-top:1rem"><span class="eyebrow">INTEGRATION STATUS</span><h2>Connected data sources</h2><p class="muted">The live crawler above works without external credentials. Search Console performance, keyword volumes, competitor SERP research and AI-assisted writing require verified OAuth/API or AI-provider connections. No sample metrics are shown as real data.</p><ul><li>Website page audit: available</li><li>Google Search Console: connection required</li><li>Keyword/SERP research provider: connection required</li><li>AI research and writing provider: connection required</li><li>Direct blog publishing: CMS workflow required</li></ul></div>
 </div>
</section>
<script>
// @ts-nocheck
import { supabaseUrl, publishableKey } from "../../lib/supabase-public";
let accessToken="";
const el=(id)=>document.getElementById(id);
const headers=()=>({apikey:publishableKey,Authorization:"Bearer "+accessToken,"Content-Type":"application/json"});
async function api(path,options={}){const r=await fetch(supabaseUrl+path,{...options,headers:{...headers(),...(options.headers||{})}});const d=await r.json().catch(()=>null);if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d?.message||d?.msg||"Request failed.");return d}
el("login-form").addEventListener("submit",async e=>{e.preventDefault();const b=el("login-button");b.disabled=true;el("login-feedback").textContent="Checking administrator access…";try{const r=await fetch(supabaseUrl+"/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",{method:"POST",headers:{apikey:publishableKey,"Content-Type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify({email:el("admin-email").value.trim(),password:el("admin-password").value})});const s=await r.json();if(!r.ok||!s.access_token)throw new Error(s.msg||s.message||"Sign in failed.");accessToken=s.access_token;const admins=await api("/rest/v1/admin_users?select=user_id&user_id=eq."+encodeURIComponent(s.user.id));if(!admins?.length)throw new Error("This account is not authorised as an administrator.");el("login-panel").hidden=true;el("manager").hidden=false;}catch(err){el("login-feedback").textContent=err.message;}finally{b.disabled=false;}});
el("logout").addEventListener("click",async()=>{try{await fetch(supabaseUrl+"/auth/v1/logout",{method:"POST",headers:headers()});}catch{}accessToken="";el("manager").hidden=true;el("login-panel").hidden=false;el("login-form").reset();});
const core=["/","/about-us","/experiences","/materuni-waterfall","/coffee-experience","/cooking-class","/faq","/contact"];
function safeCell(v){const td=document.createElement("td");td.textContent=v;td.style.padding="9px";td.style.borderBottom="1px solid #ddd";return td}
async function inspectPage(path){const url=new URL(path,location.origin);const response=await fetch(url.href,{credentials:"same-origin"});if(!response.ok)throw new Error("HTTP "+response.status);const html=await response.text();const doc=new DOMParser().parseFromString(html,"text/html");const title=doc.querySelector("title")?.textContent?.trim()||"";const desc=doc.querySelector('meta[name="description"]')?.content?.trim()||"";const h1=doc.querySelectorAll("h1").length;const canonical=doc.querySelector('link[rel="canonical"]')?.href||"";const images=[...doc.images];const missingAlt=images.filter(i=>!i.hasAttribute("alt")||!i.getAttribute("alt").trim()).length;const issues=[];if(!title)issues.push("Missing title");else if(title.length<30||title.length>60)issues.push("Title length "+title.length);if(!desc)issues.push("Missing meta description");else if(desc.length<120||desc.length>160)issues.push("Description length "+desc.length);if(h1===0)issues.push("Missing H1");if(h1>1)issues.push("Multiple H1");if(!canonical)issues.push("Missing canonical");if(missingAlt)issues.push(missingAlt+" image(s) missing alt");return {path,title,desc,h1,canonical,missingAlt,issues};}
el("run-audit").addEventListener("click",async()=>{const b=el("run-audit");b.disabled=true;el("audit-status").textContent="Discovering and checking public pages…";el("audit-results").replaceChildren();try{let paths=core;if(el("audit-scope").value==="sitemap"){const sr=await fetch("/sitemap.xml");if(sr.ok){const xml=new DOMParser().parseFromString(await sr.text(),"application/xml");const locs=[...xml.querySelectorAll("loc")].map(n=>n.textContent).filter(Boolean);if(locs.length)paths=[...new Set(locs.map(u=>new URL(u,location.origin)).filter(u=>u.origin===location.origin).map(u=>u.pathname))];}}const results=[];for(const p of paths){try{results.push(await inspectPage(p));}catch(err){results.push({path:p,title:"",desc:"",h1:0,canonical:"",missingAlt:0,issues:["Could not fetch: "+err.message]});}}const issueCount=results.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.issues.length,0);el("audit-count").textContent=results.length;el("audit-issues").textContent=issueCount;el("audit-h1").textContent=results.filter(r=>r.h1===0).length;el("audit-meta").textContent=results.filter(r=>!r.desc).length;const table=document.createElement("table");table.style.width="100%";table.style.borderCollapse="collapse";const head=document.createElement("tr");["Page","Title","H1","Findings"].forEach(v=>{const th=document.createElement("th");th.textContent=v;th.style.textAlign="left";th.style.padding="9px";head.append(th);});table.append(head);results.forEach(r=>{const tr=document.createElement("tr");tr.append(safeCell(r.path),safeCell(r.title||"—"),safeCell(r.h1),safeCell(r.issues.join(" · ")||"No basic on-page issues detected"));table.append(tr);});el("audit-results").append(table);el("audit-status").textContent="Completed at "+new Date().toLocaleString()+". Checks are technical page signals, not a Google ranking score.";}catch(err){el("audit-status").textContent="Audit failed: "+err.message;}finally{b.disabled=false;}});
el("make-brief").addEventListener("click",()=>{const topic=el("topic").value.trim();if(!topic){el("topic").focus();return;}const audience=el("audience").value,intent=el("intent").value;const out=el("research-output");out.hidden=false;out.replaceChildren();const h=document.createElement("h3");h.textContent="Research brief: "+topic;out.append(h);const sections=[["Search intent",intent+" — answer the visitor's actual question before promoting an experience."],["Audience",audience],["Seed keyword",topic],["Related angles",["how to experience "+topic,"local Chagga traditions connected with "+topic,"what visitors should know before "+topic,"responsible ways to experience "+topic]],["Research tasks",["Validate query demand and country/device split in Google Search Console or a keyword provider.","Review current top-ranking pages and record what they answer well and what they omit.","Collect first-hand facts from local hosts; verify names, customs, access details and prices.","Map the article to one relevant experience page and useful supporting pages.","Check competing pages for freshness, sources, structure and unanswered visitor questions."]],["Editorial guardrails",["Do not invent cultural traditions, statistics, review quotes, prices or availability.","Use first-hand Materuni details and clearly distinguish verified facts from suggestions.","Avoid repeating generic travel copy; add original local insight and practical visitor guidance."]]];sections.forEach(([label,value])=>{const wrap=document.createElement("div");const strong=document.createElement("strong");strong.textContent=label;wrap.append(strong);if(Array.isArray(value)){const ul=document.createElement("ul");value.forEach(v=>{const li=document.createElement("li");li.textContent=v;ul.append(li);});wrap.append(ul);}else{const p=document.createElement("p");p.textContent=value;wrap.append(p);}out.append(wrap);});const copy=document.createElement("button");copy.className="button button-secondary";copy.type="button";copy.textContent="Copy research brief";copy.addEventListener("click",()=>{const txt=out.innerText;navigator.clipboard?.writeText(txt);copy.textContent="Copied (if clipboard permission granted)";});out.append(copy);});
el("blog-description").addEventListener("input",()=>el("description-count").textContent=el("blog-description").value.length+" / 160 characters");
function getDraft(){return {title:el("blog-title").value,keyword:el("blog-keyword").value,slug:el("blog-slug").value,description:el("blog-description").value,body:el("blog-body").value,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};}
el("save-draft").addEventListener("click",()=>{try{localStorage.setItem("materuni-blog-draft",JSON.stringify(getDraft()));el("blog-feedback").textContent="Draft saved in this browser on this device only.";}catch(e){el("blog-feedback").textContent="Could not save draft: "+e.message;}});
try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("materuni-blog-draft")||"null");if(saved){el("blog-title").value=saved.title||"";el("blog-keyword").value=saved.keyword||"";el("blog-slug").value=saved.slug||"";el("blog-description").value=saved.description||"";el("blog-body").value=saved.body||"";el("description-count").textContent=el("blog-description").value.length+" / 160 characters";el("blog-feedback").textContent="A local draft was restored.";}}catch{}
el("export-draft").addEventListener("click",()=>{const d=getDraft();const md="# "+d.title+"\n\n**Primary keyword:** "+d.keyword+"\n\n**Slug:** "+d.slug+"\n\n**Meta description:** "+d.description+"\n\n"+d.body;const blob=new Blob([md],{type:"text/markdown;charset=utf-8"});const a=document.createElement("a");a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=(d.slug||"materuni-blog-draft")+".md";a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);});
</script>
</SiteLayout>
